abstract: >-
  LongChat Guard is a local-first browser extension for ChatGPT long-conversation
  warnings, conversation-length trend monitoring, context-risk reminders, and
  long-chat continuation workflows on Chrome and Microsoft Edge. It does not
  claim access to OpenAI's official token quota or exact context-window limit.
